FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785633476
OL,3,CDiscarded SpaceX rocket set to
OL,4,Cunintentionally smash into the moon
OL,6,FElon Musk's SpaceX and Jeff Bezos'
OL,7,FBlue Origin are racing to provide the
OL,8,Flander for NASA's yet-to-be-named
OL,9,Fmoonwalkers of Artemis IV, who will
OL,10,Fsucceed the 12 Apollo astronauts who
OL,11,Fstrolled the lunar surface.
OL,13,FRetired astrophysicist Jonathan
OL,14,FMcDowell said although this impact is
OL,15,Fnot a problem, "in a future where
OL,16,Fthere are long-term bases on the moon,
OL,17,Fsimilar impacts would be an issue" and
OL,18,Fwe should not leave rockets in
OL,19,F"chaotic orbits of this kind".
